            "detailed_description": "Triton Wing is an open-world, top-down, 2D shooter set in a large space environment. Influenced by arcade shoot-em-ups of the past, Triton Wing adds free-roaming and RPG-like features. Fight in space and on-planet to liberate the galaxy. Use a combination of powerful weapons to fight a large variety of enemy ships. A nice sound track and lots of explosions and effects punctuate the arcade-style feel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLarge space environment including 16 planet maps to explore<br />\r\nCustomizable weapon load-out<br />\r\nCan purchase new ships with improved stats<br />\r\nShips are infinitely upgradable<br />\r\nWarp mode to travel large distances quickly<br />\r\nCool soundtrack",
